# Table of "elementary" particles for DEGAS-2

$Id: 9cf57c8c53caedfe375abe084dd5cd0d3b69f18d $

# Data taken for CRC Handbook 1990-1991 edition.  Masses for hydrogen and
# helium isotopes are for those isotopes.  The others are for the elements
# in their "natural abundances".  The format is
# 1x,i3,1x,a3,1x,f14.10,1x,a16.

